    <tags>careeros career job-search resume interview-prep electron desktop</tags>
    <summary>Career workspace for resumes, jobs, interviews, and applications</summary>
    <description>
CareerOS is a desktop career workspace for managing resumes, jobs, interview preparation, coding practice, and AI-assisted application workflows.

This desktop build additionally supports:

- Local LaTeX resume compilation (bundled Tectonic engine, no upload required)
- Coding Arena: run and submit solutions in C, C++, Java, JavaScript, Python, or Rust entirely on your machine

An internet connection is required for sign-in and AI features.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/keshav-019/career-os/releases/tag/v1.0.0</releaseNotes>
